x.get('layer',''),'|',x.get('kind',''))\n\"","description":"List contracts"}},"apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CfY37Ayunry3crfcLAD2d","attributionAgent":"general-purpose","type":"assistant","uuid":"7bb146fb-a588-49e2-9c83-37256de14aaa","timestamp":"2026-09-29T16:21:36.262Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","userType":"external","entrypoint":"remote_mobile","cwd":"/home/user/skills","sessionId":"64f15158-6a4e-5bdf-8a90-7f2bd7b05b82","version":"2.1.284","gitBranch":"claude/engine-skill-framework-phase1"}
{"parentUuid":"7bb146fb-a588-49e2-9c83-37256de14aaa","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"9bdfc07b-8ff1-4e95-9c88-de7440fd6192","agentId":"ad30ba9cc6e95bd4e","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01NBiNjE3yf7QdqcAbqh9gDm","type":"tool_result","content":"Architectural contracts. Skills depend on contracts, never directly on another skill's internals. layer: 0 platform, 1 foundation, 2 engine services, 3 subsystems, 4 game framework, 5 tools; 'P' = process contract (not code). 'requires' = build-level interface dependencies; must be acyclic and point to the same or a lower layer. 'universal': 'runtime' = implicitly consumed by every runtime skill; 'all' = implicitly consumed by every skill.\n{\"id\": \"C-PAL\", \"layer\": 0, \"owner\": \"platform-architect\", \"name\": \"Platform abstraction layer\", \"summary\": \"OS services, CPU/GPU capability discovery and device database, windowing, display & safe area, lifecycle and system events (memory pressure, thermal/power, network reachability, audio endpoint, locale, OS accessibility settings, overlay/focus, storage, page size), clocks and clock-domain correlation, processes/pipes/shared memory/dev sockets, HTTP(S)/TLS client, permissions, thread creation/affinity/QoS and main-thread dispatch. Platform code lives only in the PAL or in a registered platform backend slot.\", \"requires\": [\"C-BASE\"], \"conformance\": true}\nC-PAL | platform-architect | Platform abstraction layer | 0 | \nC-ERR | core-runtime-architect | Error & failure model | 1 | \nC-MOD | core-runtime-architect | Module & lifecycle | 1 | \nC-CFG | core-runtime-architect | Configuration & cvars | 1 | \nC-MATH | math-simd-numerics | Math & numeric conventions | 1 | \nC-MEM | memory-allocators | Allocation & memory accounting | 1 | \nC-TYPES | containers-core-types | Core types & containers | 1 | \nC-SYNC | concurrency-primitives | Concurrency primitives & thread-safety annotations | 1 | \nC-TASK | job-system-task-graph | Task graph & job API | 1 | \nC-INSTR | observability-telemetry | Instrumentation | 1 | \nC-CRASH | crash-diagnostics | Crash & diagnostic hooks | 1 | \nC-DET | determinism-replay | Determinism | 1 | \nC-BUDGET | performance-architect | Budgets & performance gates | P | \nC-PLUGIN | plugin-system | Plugin descriptor & loading | 1 | \nC-FRAME | frame-orchestration | Frame, tick phases & time | 2 | \nC-ID | entity-object-model | Identity & references | 2 | \nC-ECS | ecs-runtime | ECS | 2 | \nC-REFL | reflection-metadata | Reflection & type metadata | 2 | \nC-SER | serialization-schema | Serialization & schema evolution | 2 | \nC-IO | async-io-storage | Async IO | 2 | \nC-VFS | package-formats-vfs | Package & VFS mounts | 2 | \nC-ASSET | content-pipeline-architect | Asset identity & references | 2 | \nC-RES | resource-streaming-architect | Resource lifetime & streaming requests | 2 | \nC-RELOAD | hot-reload-iteration | Hot reload | 2 | \nC-SPATIAL | spatial-transforms | Transforms & spatial queries | 2 | \nC-RHI | rhi-core | Render hardware interface | 2 | \nC-GPUMEM | gpu-memory-resources | GPU resources & memory | 2 | \nC-ML | ml-inference-runtime | ML inference | 2 | \nC-WORLD | world-architect | World partition & streaming cells | 3 | \nC-RG | render-graph-scheduling | Render graph | 3 | \nC-SHADER | shader-system | Shader interface & interop | 3 | \nC-MATIF | material-system | Material interface | 3 | \nC-RSCENE | render-architect | Render scene & render features | 3 | \nC-TEMPORAL | reconstruction-upscaling | Temporal data | 3 | \nC-RT | ray-tracing-infrastructure | Ray queries | 3 | \nC-TEXT | text-fonts | Text layout & glyphs | 3 | \nC-DRAW2D | render-2d-vector | 2D draw lists | 3 | \nC-PHYS | physics-architect | Physics world & scene queries | 3 | \nC-ANIM | animation-architect | Animation pose output | 3 | \nC-AUDIO | audio-architect | Audio emitters & events | 3 | \nC-INPUT | input-system | Input actions | 3 | \nC-NET | network-architect | Netcode model & authority policy | 3 | \nC-SVC | platform-services | Platform services | 3 | \nC-LOC | localization-i18n | Localized strings | 3 | \nC-UI | ui-architect | UI widgets & binding | 3 | \nC-NAV | navigation-pathfinding | Navigation queries | 3 | \nC-GAME | gameplay-architect | Gameplay framework extension | 4 | \nC-SCRIPT | scripting-runtime | Script bindings | 3 | \nC-SAVE | persistence-save | Save games | 3 | \nC-COOK | content-pipeline-architect | Cook-step processors | 5 | \nC-EDCMD | editor-architect | Editor commands & tool extension | 5 | \nC-GRAPH | graph-editor-framework | Graph authoring & compilation | 5 | \nC-BUILD | build-system-toolchains | Build description | 5 | \nC-PKG | packaging-release-patching | Release packages & patches | 5 | \nC-ARCH | engine-architect | Architecture, layering & profiles | P | \nC-ADR | architecture-governance | ADR & fitness functions | P | \nC-EVID | research-evidence | Evidence grading | P | \nC-ORCH | program-orchestration | Agent coordination protocol | P | \nC-TEST | test-architect | Test & validation definition of done | P | \nC-API | api-lifecycle-migration | API stability & deprecation | P | \nC-TRUST | security-engineering | Trust boundaries | P | \nC-A11Y | accessibility | Accessibility requirements | P | \nC-BASE | platform-architect | Bootstrap base | 0 | \nC-LIFETIME | core-runtime-architect | Ownership & retirement | 1 | \nC-IPC | core-runtime-architect | Engine IPC | 2 | \nC-SCALE | runtime-scalability | Scalability & governor | 1 | \nC-FLOW | frame-orchestration | Cross-subsystem data channels | 2 | \nC-PRESENT | frame-orchestration | Present timeline | 2 | \nC-SNAPSHOT | determinism-replay | Frame-state snapshot & resimulation | 2 | \nC-REPLAY | determinism-replay | Replay container & streams | 3 | \nC-VIEW | spatial-transforms | Views & view arbitration | 2 | \nC-SIGNIF | world-architect | Significance & simulation tiers | 2 | \nC-ENV | world-architect | Environment queries | 3 | \nC-GPUTIER | gpu-platform-architect | GPU feature tiers | 2 | \nC-INSTANCES | geometry-pipeline | Instance scene | 3 | \nC-GEOLOD | virtualized-geometry-lod | Geometry LOD & page residency | 3 | \nC-VT | texture-streaming-vt | Texture residency & virtual texturing | 3 | \nC-LIGHT | direct-lighting-shadows | Direct lighting sampling | 3 | \nC-GI | global-illumination | Indirect lighting sampling | 3 | \nC-ATMOS | atmosphere-weather | Atmosphere & participating media | 3 | \nC-VIDEO | media-playback | Video surfaces | 3 | \nC-DEVICE | input-devices-haptics | Input devices & haptics | 2 | \nC-NETLINK | network-transport | Network links & sessions | 2 | \nC-REP | replication | Replication | 3 | \nC-PREDICT | prediction-rollback | Prediction & rollback | 3 | \nC-MOVE | character-movement | Character movement | 4 | \nC-GAMEDATA | gameplay-data | Gameplay data | 3 | \nC-DIALOGUE | narrative-dialogue | Dialogue lines & narrative state | 3 | \nC-AIAGENT | ai-behavior-perception | AI decision-provider extension point | 4 | \nC-A11YRT | accessibility | Accessibility runtime | 3 | \nC-DEVUI | visual-debugging-tools | Developer UI | 3 | \nC-EDHOST | editor-ui-framework | Editor host | 5 | \nC-LIVE | online-services-liveops | Online & live-ops services | 3 | \nC-XRVIEW | xr-runtime | XR views | 3 | \nC-MLGPU | ml-inference-runtime | GPU inference | 3 | \nC-CERT | certification-compliance | External requirements register | P | \nC-PERF | performance-architect | Performance findings protocol | P | \nC-BENCH | perf-benchmarking | Benchmark registration | P | \nC-PROD | engine-product-management | Engine roadmap & intake | P | \nC-RELEASE | build-release-architect | Release model | P |","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"537d135d-8583-4f7e-869b-637031524593","timestamp":"2026-09-29T16:21:36.381Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"7bb146fb-a588-49e2-9c83-37256de14aaa","userType":"external","entrypoint":"remote_mobile","cwd":"/home/user/skills","sessionId":"64f15158-6a4e-5bdf-8a90-7f2bd7b05b82","version":"2.1.284","gitBranch":"claude/engi